This library depends on the following packages, which are fetched at build time
and are not redistributed here:

- Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), Apache License 2.0.
- nominal-lean (https://github.com/spitters/nominal-lean), MIT License.

The library follows the design of SSProve (https://github.com/SSProve/ssprove,
MIT License), and several game definitions mirror EasyCrypt developments
(https://github.com/EasyCrypt/easycrypt); no source code of either is included.

Specifications formalised in this library are cited in the module docstrings,
among them NIST FIPS 203, Module-Lattice-Based Key-Encapsulation Mechanism
Standard (2024).
